    },
    {
      "text": "在数百个半程序生成的小关卡中完成不同目标并迎战尸潮与首领。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "During your expeditions, you can expect to run into various zombie-like creatures, including many boss fights in hundreds of semi-procedurally generated mini-levels which you have to complete different objectives to proceed.",
